        <profile name="Call the Attack" id="d509-5206-1044-025a" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">STRATEGIC GAMBIT if this operative doesn&apos;t have one of your Frenzy tokens. Select one friendly FELLGOR RAVAGER operative visible to and within 6&quot; of this operative. That selected operative, and each other friendly FELLGOR RAVAGER operative visible to and within 2&quot; of it, can immediately perform a free **Dash** action in an order of your choice.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
