          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">Whenever an enemy operative is visible to and within 3&quot; of this operative, if this operative isn’t within control range of any other enemy operatives: 
- Subtract 1 from the Atk stat of that enemy operative’s melee weapons (to a minimum of 1).
- Your opponent must spend 1 additional AP for that enemy operative to perform the Fall Back action.</characteristic>
